    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "The Masquerade is a murder party game from 2 to 8 players where you're simultaneously a target and a hunter. Impersonate NPCs to hide from your hunter, while gathering enough clues to unmask and eliminate your target.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595530/extras/fe2f0a8b5ccc52582bd5527b6dfc15c8.poster.avif?t=1751986765\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595530/extras/fe2f0a8b5ccc52582bd5527b6dfc15c8.webm?t=1751986765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595530/extras/fe2f0a8b5ccc52582bd5527b6dfc15c8.mp4?t=1751986765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The goal of the game is to get the maximum amount of coins before the end of the round. You earn coins each time you eliminate your target, or kill your hunter. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Blend in with NPCs to avoid being suspicious<br></li><li> Explore the manor to find a variety of deadly weapons. Poison, crossbow, dynamit, dagger... the choice is yours! <br></li><li> Identify your target amongst the crowd of NPCs<br></li><li> Exploit alternative strategies to earn coins. Every strategy is a good one! <br></li><li> Uncover the many secrets and hidden rooms of the manor.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Customize your games: Choose from a variety of map, BOT, weapon and more options to bring variety and adjust the game to your preferences. <br></li><li> Experience a variety of game modes: Free for all, Team vs team or Battle-royal! <br></li><li> Open up your own private server and play with a group of friends, or join public servers<br></li><li> Enjoy free updates that bring more maps and customization options!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "The Masquerade is a murder party game from 2 to 8 players where you're simultaneously a target and a hunter. Impersonate NPCs to hide from your hunter, while gathering enough clues to unmask and eliminate your target.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595530/extras/fe2f0a8b5ccc52582bd5527b6dfc15c8.poster.avif?t=1751986765\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595530/extras/fe2f0a8b5ccc52582bd5527b6dfc15c8.webm?t=1751986765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595530/extras/fe2f0a8b5ccc52582bd5527b6dfc15c8.mp4?t=1751986765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The goal of the game is to get the maximum amount of coins before the end of the round. You earn coins each time you eliminate your target, or kill your hunter. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Blend in with NPCs to avoid being suspicious<br></li><li> Explore the manor to find a variety of deadly weapons. Poison, crossbow, dynamit, dagger... the choice is yours! <br></li><li> Identify your target amongst the crowd of NPCs<br></li><li> Exploit alternative strategies to earn coins. Every strategy is a good one! <br></li><li> Uncover the many secrets and hidden rooms of the manor.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Customize your games: Choose from a variety of map, BOT, weapon and more options to bring variety and adjust the game to your preferences. <br></li><li> Experience a variety of game modes: Free for all, Team vs team or Battle-royal! <br></li><li> Open up your own private server and play with a group of friends, or join public servers<br></li><li> Enjoy free updates that bring more maps and customization options!</li></ul>",
